Credits & third-party assets
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Tokyo Daybreak is a fork of the "Nous" Omarchy theme by nnul
(https://github.com/notkisk/omarchy-nous-theme), adapted with a Tokyo
Day / Tokyo Night style. The Nous theme code is MIT-licensed; the copyright
notice and license above are retained as required by the MIT License.

The images and artwork in this theme are NOT original to Tokyo Daybreak and
are NOT covered by the MIT License above. They remain the property of their
respective rightful owners:

- backgrounds/blue-anime-wallpaper.webp — third-party anime wallpaper,
  source: wallpaperbat.com (https://wallpaperbat.com). Copyright remains
  with the original artist/publisher. All rights reserved.
- backgrounds/blue-anime-aesthetic-wallpaper.webp — third-party anime
  wallpaper, source: wallpaperbat.com (https://wallpaperbat.com). Copyright
  remains with the original artist/publisher. All rights reserved.
- backgrounds/winding-road.webp — from the "Tokyo Day" Omarchy theme by
  lexeko (https://github.com/lexeko/omarchy-tokyo-day-theme).
- preview.png — screenshot taken by the Tokyo Daybreak author.
